    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>♈ Aries is ascendant today.</strong> Your Cloth is awake. For the whole day your Techniques heighten as though you were <strong>4 levels higher</strong>, and you have your Ascendant Boon.</p><p>You gain a +2 status bonus to AC and to all saving throws.</p><p><strong>Star Guard</strong> &#8617; (reaction; once per round; trigger a creature within 60 feet makes a ranged or spell attack, or targets an ally with a spell) &mdash; the effect goes <em>nowhere</em>. It is expended with no result.</p><p>You also gain <strong>Dimension Step</strong> &#9670; (teleport 60 feet).</p><hr /><p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Ascendant Constellation]. Applied and removed by the module's sky tracker; a GM can also drag it on by hand.</p>"
        },
